{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Observe the Sabbath day</b> — שמור את יום. The notarikon of שאיה and ס\"ת רתם: to teach you that those punishable by שאיה and glowing coals of רתם rest on the Sabbath."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 5, :notes {0 "The comment parses ר\"ת (initial letters) of שמור את יום as שאיה, and ס\"ת (end letters) as רתם; the reference is to forms of execution/punishment that do not override Sabbath rest."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:08:53.672641813Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}